#====================================================================
# E243 — Protocol-data packages need per-document generator tests
#====================================================================

id:                     E243
trigger_tool:           conan_test|python|xmllint|pkg-config
phase:                  testing|packaging
error_signature:        protocol generator validation failed|installed XML, Python, or pkg-config metadata is incomplete or non-relocatable|module output callback order is incorrect

severity:               2
category:               testing|protocol-data|generator-api|package-discovery
match_keywords:         protocol XML, schema, code generator, per-document test, xcbgen, pkg-config, PYTHONPATH, relocatable data package
title:                  Protocol-data packages need per-document generator tests

root_cause:             A data-only protocol package can contain the expected file count and pass one schema command while still being unusable: imports may be missing, generator semantic resolution may fail, Python modules may be installed outside the exported search path, or pkg-config variables may point outside the package. File inventory, schema validity, generator behavior, and installed discovery are separate contracts.
affected_scope:         Packages that distribute machine-readable protocol/schema documents together with Python or other language-independent parsers and generators instead of a linked library.
verification_cmd:       conan create <recipe> -pr:h=<target-profile> -pr:b=<target-profile> --build='*'

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           per-document-generator-plus-discovery-matrix
rec_description:        Lock the upstream document and module inventories. Preserve the upstream schema test, but also run every installed protocol input through the real generator registration and semantic-resolution API in a separate process. Add unique fixtures for public semantic branches and verify that pkg-config and language search paths resolve inside the installed package.
rec_command:            conan create <recipe> -pr:h=<target-profile> -pr:b=<target-profile> --build='*'
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               installed-protocol-generator-test-suite

fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      schema-and-installed-smoke
fallback_description:   If the generator cannot run on the target, execute the authoritative schema suite and an installed discovery smoke, then record generator execution as an explicit unresolved test gap rather than claiming full consumer coverage.
fallback_command:
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:

forbid_1_pattern:       (count|glob|list).*(xml|schema).*(only|enough)|assert.*file.*exists.*return.*0
forbid_1_reason:        Inventory-only tests do not execute imports, expression handling, type resolution, or generator callbacks.
forbid_1_consequence:   The package looks complete but downstream code generation fails after publication.
forbid_2_pattern:       (schema|generator).*(shared|static|repeat).*(count|case)|assertion.*split.*test
forbid_2_reason:        Repeating the same input or splitting its assertions does not create an independent protocol workflow.
forbid_2_consequence:   Reported coverage is inflated without increasing semantic or input coverage.

principles:
causes:                 []
caused_by:              []
similar_to:             []
conflicts_with:         []
prerequisite_of:        []

